Test Scenario B: Finalizer Failure Handling & Log State Isolation (R5-02)
================================================================================

Objective:
Prove that if `--finalize` fails with non-zero exit code (e.g., injected exit 42):
1. The runner does NOT claim success or write "completed successfully with EXIT=0".
