================================================================================
Test Scenario C: Catch Block Unhandled Exception Details & Decoupling (R5-03, R6-04)
================================================================================

Objective:
Prove that the unhandled exception catch block in `run-webview.ps1`:
1. Logs the exact failing Step name and command.
2. Logs the full exception type and message.
3. Preserves captured process output or marks UNAVAILABLE.
4. Preserves the full script / exception stack trace.
5. Never assumes $LASTEXITCODE is from the failing step unless that step actually ran a native command.
6. Flushes the log and marks Status: FAILED before exiting 1.

Method:
Dual verification consisting of live execution reproduction via `-ExceptionTest` and static AST/code review.

1. Live Execution Command:
  powershell.exe -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File verification/P02/run-webview.ps1 -ExceptionTest

